--------------- Update Information---------------
mysql> UPDATE Patient SET blood_group = 'O-' where patientID = 2;


mysql> Select * From Patient where patientID = 2;

o/p - 
+-----------+--------+------------+------------+---------+-------------+
| patientID | name   | dob        | contact    | address | blood_group |
+-----------+--------+------------+------------+---------+-------------+
|         2 | Ritesh | 2026-02-10 | 8448738392 | Piplani | O-          |
+-----------+--------+------------+------------+---------+-------------+



